{"id": "EUVD-2026-97377", "enisaUuid": "672b8f14-64d3-3cd0-be84-dd9737bd6df7", "description": "yshop-crm through 2.1.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows any authenticated back-office user to approve or reject invoices via POST /admin-api/crm/invoice/check. The CrmInvoiceController check handler lacks @PreAuthorize and approver checks are commented out, letting attackers bypass the invoice approval workflow by supplying any invoice id.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T13:10:34", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T15:05:09", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/yshop-crm/poc_crm_invoice_check.py", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm/blob/a77250f7ace63d5b6b363841d9ff441e0e2a9a6b/yshop-crm/yshop-module-crm/yshop-module-crm-biz/src/main/java/co/yixiang/yshop/module/crm/controller/admin/crminvoice/CrmInvoiceController.java#L72-L78", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm/blob/a77250f7ace63d5b6b363841d9ff441e0e2a9a6b/yshop-crm/yshop-module-crm/yshop-module-crm-biz/src/main/java/co/yixiang/yshop/module/crm/service/crminvoice/CrmInvoiceServiceImpl.java#L219-L315", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm/blob/a77250f7ace63d5b6b363841d9ff441e0e2a9a6b/yshop-crm/sql/yshop-crm-open-source.sql#L2597", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/yshop-crm-through-2.1.3-missing-authorization-via-invoice-check-endpoint"], "aliases": ["GHSA-59m8-j2f8-vc8x", "CVE-2026-109173"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "318174ff-e49d-3ae0-8e0b-f83b10fa7c53", "product": {"name": "yshop-crm", "vendor": {"name": "guchengwuyue"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.1.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "7fba4d80-d390-3c63-9775-75892fd57327", "vendor": {"name": "guchengwuyue"}}], "isExploited": false}